---
// Waxlight Wiki is a dark-only site (as the original Wiki).
// This override forces `data-theme="dark"` before paint instead of
// following the OS `prefers-color-scheme`, keeping the Waxlight identity
// and avoiding a flash of an unstyled light layout.
---

<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
</script>
